---
/**
 * Port of the old site's `service-crm-bots.html` `#ejemplo` live demo.
 * Verbatim markup and class names; used-selector CSS remapped to v2 tokens
 * under the `[data-demo="bots-crm"]` root (design D3). One guarded inline
 * IIFE (D1/D4). RM: CSS-only (drag & drop + filter are user-driven; the old
 * page ships no RM tweaks for these selectors).
 * Directed adaptations: old CTAs dropped; 🤖 stripped from the hint;
 * vendor SVG logo strip → text chips (6 CRM names, matches the old file).
 * Layout: old 1100px media block → container queries on the root (D5).
 * Tooltips inside cards are pure CSS; mobile static fallback stays @media.
 */
---
<div class="example-inner example-inner-wide" data-demo="bots-crm">
    <span class="example-badge">Ejemplo en vivo</span>
    <h3 class="example-outcome">Ningún lead se queda sin atender</h3>
    <p class="example-sub">Arrastra oportunidades entre etapas y consulta cada negocio sin salir del tablero.</p>
    <p class="example-sample-note">Datos de muestra con fines ilustrativos.</p>
    <div class="example-frame">
        <div class="example-frame-bar"><span class="example-frame-dot"></span><span class="example-frame-dot"></span><span class="example-frame-dot"></span><span class="example-frame-title">Pipeline · HubSpot / Salesforce</span></div>
        <div class="example-frame-body">
            <div class="example-crm-shell">
                <div class="example-crm-header">
                    <div><strong>Creatio-style · Pipeline de ventas</strong><br><span>Arrastra las tarjetas entre columnas · Datos de muestra</span></div>
                    <span>+ Nueva oportunidad</span>
                </div>
                <div class="example-pipeline" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="example-pipeline-stage example-pipeline-done">Qualification</span>
                    <span class="example-pipeline-stage example-pipeline-done">Presentation</span>
                    <span class="example-pipeline-stage">Proposal</span>
                    <span class="example-pipeline-stage">Contracting</span>
                    <span class="example-pipeline-stage">Closed won</span>
                </div>
                <div class="example-crm-toolbar">
                    <label class="example-crm-filter" for="crmFilter">Filtrar por responsable
                        <input id="crmFilter" type="search" placeholder="Ej.: Ana" autocomplete="off">
                    </label>
                    <span class="example-crm-visible" id="crmVisible">11 oportunidades</span>
                </div>
                <div class="example-crm-scroll">
                    <div class="example-kanban example-crm-board example-crm-board-5" id="crmBoard">
                        <div class="example-crm-col" data-col="Qualification">
                            <div class="example-crm-col-head"><h4>Qualification</h4><span class="example-crm-col-stats"><b data-count>3</b> · <b data-total></b></span></div>
                            <div class="example-crm-card" draggable="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-opp-1" data-owner="Ana Torres" data-value="32.5"><strong>Distribuidora Andina S.A.S.</strong><span class="example-crm-value">$32,5M COP</span><span class="example-crm-meta">Cierre: 18 oct · 25% prob.</span><br><span class="example-crm-tag example-crm-tag-hot">Hot</span><span class="example-crm-owner"><i>AT</i> Ana Torres · Descubrimiento</span><span class="example-crm-tip" id="tip-opp-1" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Contacto:</strong> Carlos Rojas</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Email:</strong> crojas@andina.co</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Teléfono:</strong> +57 601 555 0132</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Última actividad:</strong> Llamada de descubrimiento · 2 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Próxima tarea:</strong> Enviar ficha técnica · 9 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Valor:</strong> $32,5M COP</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Probabilidad:</strong> 25%</span></span></div>
                            <div class="example-crm-card" draggable="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-opp-2" data-owner="Luis Gómez" data-value="18.9"><strong>Café Sierra Nevada</strong><span class="example-crm-value">$18,9M COP</span><span class="example-crm-meta">Cierre: 25 oct · 20% prob.</span><br><span class="example-crm-tag example-crm-tag-warm">Warm</span><span class="example-crm-owner"><i>LG</i> Luis Gómez · Primer contacto</span><span class="example-crm-tip" id="tip-opp-2" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Contacto:</strong> María Páez</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Email:</strong> mpaez@sierranevada.co</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Teléfono:</strong> +57 605 555 0188</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Última actividad:</strong> Formulario web · 3 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Próxima tarea:</strong> Llamada de calificación · 10 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Valor:</strong> $18,9M COP</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Probabilidad:</strong> 20%</span></span></div>
                            <div class="example-crm-card" draggable="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-opp-3" data-owner="Marta Cifuentes" data-value="54.0"><strong>Logística Caribe S.A.S.</strong><span class="example-crm-value">$54,0M COP</span><span class="example-crm-meta">Cierre: 30 oct · 30% prob.</span><br><span class="example-crm-tag example-crm-tag-warm">Warm</span><span class="example-crm-owner"><i>MC</i> Marta Cifuentes · Visita agendada</span><span class="example-crm-tip" id="tip-opp-3" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Contacto:</strong> Jorge Vélez</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Email:</strong> jvelez@logcaribe.co</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Teléfono:</strong> +57 605 555 0145</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Última actividad:</strong> Email con catálogo · 1 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Próxima tarea:</strong> Visita en Barranquilla · 11 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Valor:</strong> $54,0M COP</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Probabilidad:</strong> 30%</span></span></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="example-crm-col" data-col="Presentation">
                            <div class="example-crm-col-head"><h4>Presentation</h4><span class="example-crm-col-stats"><b data-count>2</b> · <b data-total></b></span></div>
                            <div class="example-crm-card" draggable="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-opp-4" data-owner="Ana Torres" data-value="42.7"><strong>Textiles Medellín S.A.S.</strong><span class="example-crm-value">$42,7M COP</span><span class="example-crm-meta">Cierre: 12 nov · 45% prob.</span><br><span class="example-crm-tag example-crm-tag-hot">Hot</span><span class="example-crm-owner"><i>AT</i> Ana Torres · Demo realizada</span><span class="example-crm-tip" id="tip-opp-4" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Contacto:</strong> Lucía Herrera</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Email:</strong> lherrera@textilesmed.co</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Teléfono:</strong> +57 604 555 0171</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Última actividad:</strong> Demo virtual · 30 ago</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Próxima tarea:</strong> Enviar propuesta · 9 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Valor:</strong> $42,7M COP</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Probabilidad:</strong> 45%</span></span></div>
                            <div class="example-crm-card" draggable="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-opp-5" data-owner="Luis Gómez" data-value="68.3"><strong>Energía Renovable Andina</strong><span class="example-crm-value">$68,3M COP</span><span class="example-crm-meta">Cierre: 15 nov · 50% prob.</span><br><span class="example-crm-tag example-crm-tag-warm">Warm</span><span class="example-crm-owner"><i>LG</i> Luis Gómez · Cotización pedida</span><span class="example-crm-tip" id="tip-opp-5" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Contacto:</strong> Andrés Peña</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Email:</strong> apena@erandina.co</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Teléfono:</strong> +57 601 555 0119</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Última actividad:</strong> Presentación técnica · 28 ago</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Próxima tarea:</strong> Reunión con gerencia · 12 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Valor:</strong> $68,3M COP</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Probabilidad:</strong> 50%</span></span></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="example-crm-col" data-col="Proposal">
                            <div class="example-crm-col-head"><h4>Proposal</h4><span class="example-crm-col-stats"><b data-count>2</b> · <b data-total></b></span></div>
                            <div class="example-crm-card" draggable="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-opp-6" data-owner="Marta Cifuentes" data-value="96.4"><strong>Constructora Horizonte</strong><span class="example-crm-value">$96,4M COP</span><span class="example-crm-meta">Cierre: 28 nov · 65% prob.</span><br><span class="example-crm-tag example-crm-tag-hot">Hot</span><span class="example-crm-owner"><i>MC</i> Marta Cifuentes · Propuesta enviada</span><span class="example-crm-tip" id="tip-opp-6" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Contacto:</strong> Felipe Orozco</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Email:</strong> forozco@horizonte.co</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Teléfono:</strong> +57 601 555 0160</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Última actividad:</strong> Propuesta v2 enviada · 3 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Próxima tarea:</strong> Seguimiento comité · 10 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Valor:</strong> $96,4M COP</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Probabilidad:</strong> 65%</span></span></div>
                            <div class="example-crm-card" draggable="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-opp-7" data-owner="Ana Torres" data-value="74.2"><strong>Clínica San Rafael</strong><span class="example-crm-value">$74,2M COP</span><span class="example-crm-meta">Cierre: 20 nov · 60% prob.</span><br><span class="example-crm-tag example-crm-tag-warm">Warm</span><span class="example-crm-owner"><i>AT</i> Ana Torres · En comité</span><span class="example-crm-tip" id="tip-opp-7" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Contacto:</strong> Dra. Paola León</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Email:</strong> pleon@sanrafael.co</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Teléfono:</strong> +57 601 555 0127</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Última actividad:</strong> Reunión comité · 29 ago</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Próxima tarea:</strong> Ajustar alcance · 11 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Valor:</strong> $74,2M COP</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Probabilidad:</strong> 60%</span></span></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="example-crm-col" data-col="Contracting">
                            <div class="example-crm-col-head"><h4>Contracting</h4><span class="example-crm-col-stats"><b data-count>2</b> · <b data-total></b></span></div>
                            <div class="example-crm-card" draggable="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-opp-8" data-owner="Luis Gómez" data-value="58.9"><strong>Alimentos del Valle S.A.S.</strong><span class="example-crm-value">$58,9M COP</span><span class="example-crm-meta">Cierre: 5 dic · 80% prob.</span><br><span class="example-crm-tag example-crm-tag-hot">Hot</span><span class="example-crm-owner"><i>LG</i> Luis Gómez · Contrato en revisión</span><span class="example-crm-tip" id="tip-opp-8" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Contacto:</strong> Camilo Duarte</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Email:</strong> cduarte@alivalle.co</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Teléfono:</strong> +57 602 555 0153</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Última actividad:</strong> Minuta enviada · 4 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Próxima tarea:</strong> Firma gerencia · 9 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Valor:</strong> $58,9M COP</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Probabilidad:</strong> 80%</span></span></div>
                            <div class="example-crm-card" draggable="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-opp-9" data-owner="Marta Cifuentes" data-value="39.8"><strong>TechSoluciones Bogotá</strong><span class="example-crm-value">$39,8M COP</span><span class="example-crm-meta">Cierre: 8 dic · 75% prob.</span><br><span class="example-crm-tag example-crm-tag-warm">Warm</span><span class="example-crm-owner"><i>MC</i> Marta Cifuentes · Validación jurídica</span><span class="example-crm-tip" id="tip-opp-9" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Contacto:</strong> Diana Castro</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Email:</strong> dcastro@techsol.co</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Teléfono:</strong> +57 601 555 0194</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Última actividad:</strong> Revisión jurídica · 2 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Próxima tarea:</strong> Firma digital · 12 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Valor:</strong> $39,8M COP</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Probabilidad:</strong> 75%</span></span></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="example-crm-col" data-col="Closed won">
                            <div class="example-crm-col-head"><h4>Closed won</h4><span class="example-crm-col-stats"><b data-count>2</b> · <b data-total></b></span></div>
                            <div class="example-crm-card" draggable="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-opp-10" data-owner="Ana Torres" data-value="87.5"><strong>Hotel Cartagena Bay</strong><span class="example-crm-value">$87,5M COP ✔</span><span class="example-crm-meta">Cerrada: 4 sep · 100% prob.</span><br><span class="example-crm-tag example-crm-tag-hot">Hot</span><span class="example-crm-owner"><i>AT</i> Ana Torres · Onboarding iniciado</span><span class="example-crm-tip" id="tip-opp-10" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Contacto:</strong> Sofía Marín</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Email:</strong> smarin@cartagenabay.co</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Teléfono:</strong> +57 605 555 0121</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Última actividad:</strong> Contrato firmado · 4 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Próxima tarea:</strong> Kickoff onboarding · 10 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Valor:</strong> $87,5M COP</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Probabilidad:</strong> 100%</span></span></div>
                            <div class="example-crm-card" draggable="true" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tip-opp-11" data-owner="Luis Gómez" data-value="63.1"><strong>Laboratorios VitalCare</strong><span class="example-crm-value">$63,1M COP ✔</span><span class="example-crm-meta">Cerrada: 2 sep · 100% prob.</span><br><span class="example-crm-tag example-crm-tag-warm">Warm</span><span class="example-crm-owner"><i>LG</i> Luis Gómez · Póliza activada</span><span class="example-crm-tip" id="tip-opp-11" role="tooltip"><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Contacto:</strong> Dr. Martín Suescún</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Email:</strong> msuescun@vitalcare.co</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Teléfono:</strong> +57 601 555 0176</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Última actividad:</strong> Pago inicial · 2 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Próxima tarea:</strong> Implementación · 15 sep</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Valor:</strong> $63,1M COP</span><span class="example-tip-line"><strong>Probabilidad:</strong> 100%</span></span></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="example-crm-footer"><span>Total pipeline <strong id="crmTotal">$636,3M COP</strong></span><span id="crmCount">11 oportunidades · Datos de muestra</span></div>
                <p class="example-crm-hint">Auto-asignación round-robin + recordatorio si una tarjeta lleva &gt;24 h quieta.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="example-cta-row example-cta-box">
        <p class="example-channels-title">Trabajamos con los CRM más populares</p>
        <ul class="example-channels">
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>HubSpot</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>Salesforce</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>Zoho</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>Pipedrive</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>Freshsales</span></li>
            <li class="example-channel-item"><span>Monday CRM</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="example-slogan">Dinos tu CRM y lo automatizamos</p>
    </div>
</div>

<style is:global>
/* CRM board demo — old demos.css used-selectors rebased from .live-example
   to [data-demo="bots-crm"], colors remapped to v2 tokens (design D3/D7).
   Old purple board (#6d28d9/#8b5cf6/#4c1d95) → var(--primary-text) system. */

[data-demo="bots-crm"] {
    --demo-ok: #4ade80;
    --demo-warn: #fbbf24;
    --demo-danger: #f87171;
    max-width: 1400px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    container-type: inline-size;
}

html[data-theme="light"] [data-demo="bots-crm"] {
    --demo-ok: #15803d;
    --demo-warn: #b45309;
    --demo-danger: #b91c1c;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] h3.example-outcome {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-sub {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    max-width: 700px;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-sample-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 28px;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-frame {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    text-align: left;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-frame-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--card);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 12px 18px;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-frame-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--muted);
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-frame-dot:first-child { background: var(--primary); }
[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-frame-dot:nth-child(2) { background: var(--primary); }
[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-frame-dot:nth-child(3) { background: var(--primary); }

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-frame-title {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-left: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-frame-body {
    padding: 20px;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-shell {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-header {
    background: var(--primary-text);
    color: var(--bg);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-header strong {
    font-size: 1rem;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-header span {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 85%, transparent);
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-pipeline {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: var(--surface);
    overflow-x: auto;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-pipeline-stage {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 110px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: var(--primary-text);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 12%, var(--card));
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 8px 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-pipeline-stage.example-pipeline-done {
    background: var(--primary-text);
    color: var(--bg);
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-toolbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 12%, transparent);
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-filter {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary-text);
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-filter input {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 30%, transparent);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    min-width: 200px;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-filter input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--primary-text);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-text) 15%, transparent);
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-visible {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary-text);
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-scroll {
    background: var(--surface);
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-kanban {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-board {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px;
    background: var(--surface);
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-board-5 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(230px, 1fr));
    padding: 16px;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: start;
}

[data-demo="bots-crm"] .example-crm-col {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--card) 70%, transparent);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px;
    min-height: 420px;
    overflow: visible;
    border: 2px dashed transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
}

